2026-06-29 17:50:11,224 | AGENT | SecurityCompliance Agent answered: To meet the tender requirements, we already have in place several necessary security measures. For data protection, we utilize encryption in transit with TLS 1.3 and encryption at rest with AES-256, with key management handled through our EU-based infrastructure. We also implement strict partitioning with logical isolation per client and per mission, preventing any cross-client circulation of data. Additionally, pseudonymisation is used where relevant, and we adhere to data minimization principles. Our hosting partner, OuraneCloud, provides a SecNumCloud compliant layer, ensuring sovereign hosting of confidential data within the EU. 

