2026-06-29 17:53:16,457 | AGENT | AIInnovation Agent answered: Our AI capabilities at Faber IA, grounded in retrieval-augmented generation, can support intelligent assistance for information retrieval, drafting professional documents, handling client files, and collaboration between professionals. The core approach of our Atelier platform ensures that every answer is generated from passages retrieved from the client's controlled corpus and cites those passages, providing transparency and explainability.

To address the needs of information retrieval, our hybrid retrieval capabilities combining lexical and semantic approaches can efficiently locate relevant information within the corpus. For drafting professional documents, template-guided drafting allows for the creation of structured and coherent texts such as client letters, mission notes, and file syntheses, all grounded in validated material to ensure reliability.

